        <p>Outstanding commission dues of <strong>₹${Number(amountCleared).toFixed(2)}</strong> have been successfully collected from partner <strong>${partnerName}</strong> (${partnerRole} fleet).</p>
        <p>The partner's account has been successfully unblocked and their commission trackers have been cleanly reset.</p>
        <p>Date/Time: ${new Date().toLocaleString("en-IN")}</p>
